  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building capacity in Thailand and South East Asian countries to improve skills for utilising large facilities.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Newton Fund builds research and innovation partnerships with developing countries across the world to promote the economic development and social welfare of the partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme supports Thai researchers to access ISIS Neutron and Muon source and the delivery of skills-based workshops. The aim of the programme is to upskills Thai researchers to make more effective use of large-scale infrastructures in the UK and around the world thus aiding their research into local priority areas.</narrative>
  </description>
